  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Simple_Backups/BH_SB_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"229\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此模组用于创建备份。您可以定义需要保留的备份数量，还可以定义最大存储空间限制。最旧的备份文件将被删除。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此模组仅可在服务器上运行。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">手动备份可通过以下命令触发：</span>/simplebackups backup start</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmelanx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Simple_Backups/BH_SB_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"Werbung\" width=\"1903\" height=\"381\"></span></a><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">#广告 #Ad</span></span></p>",
